<http://data.silknow.org/object/7210f26a-b469-3d51-a3e7-0ef6e55f404a/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Triangular shawl of embroidered brown satin with coloured floss silks in long and short, stem and satin stitches and French knots. The design consists of a border along two side of trailing stems of various flowers and a bunch of flowers at the central point, all worked in bright colours. The shawl is edged with a piping of brown satin and along the two shorter sides with a brown silk fringe. Lined with bright yellow silk with a woven design of tiny flower sprigs."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7210f26a-b469-3d51-a3e7-0ef6e55f404a> .

